<!-- KLIC native HTML example. Styles/interactions: component bundle. KLIC example; preserve bundled per-file license notices. -->
<div data-klic-component="notification" class="kn-notification"><div data-part="notification"><strong>미확인 알림 <span data-notification-count>2</span></strong><article data-unread="true"><p>김하늘님이 검토를 요청했어요.</p><button type="button" data-cmp-action="read-notification"  data-part="btn" class="kv-neutral kv-sm">읽음</button></article><article data-unread="true"><p>컴포넌트 문서가 업데이트됐어요.</p><button type="button" data-cmp-action="read-notification"  data-part="btn" class="kv-neutral kv-sm">읽음</button></article></div><p data-cmp-status role="status" aria-live="polite" data-part="status"></p></div>
